@@section 1
@@title SQ-CMP Creative Compat carve, 2026-11-01 ([creative_compat.md](../creative_compat.md) 4, TODO `creativesplit/compat #5`)
@@date 2026-11-01
@@jars creativecommon creativecompat
@@sources feature_writeup/creative_compat.md
@@text
@@text Run 2026-11-01 (rcs234, [scratch_run_2026-11-01.md](scratch_run_2026-11-01.md) 7): SQ-CMP-01 to -06 and -08 PASS; -07 LOOK (count is a client check).
@@text
@@text Same boots as SQ-CS2 (boot 2 is the first with `creativecompat-1.0.0.jar`), instance config with the six sections still
@@text in `creativeengineering-common.toml` and no `creativecompat-common.toml` (delete it in the scratch copy first; edit one
@@text value, `[campfire] rainOutTicks`, before boot 1).
