## SQ-CMP-08 | moved server scripts, /reload
@group A
@commands Same boot: `grep -E "Error occurred while handling event\|creativecompat" logs/kubejs/server.log logs/latest.log \| head`; `/reload`
@pass No script error from the moved server files (coin, starter kit, feature ports, flowers, misc mods, tag rows); `/reload` clean
@fails A moved script reading a top-level name from the pack's scope
@from batches/r1101/cs2_boot2.qb
shell grep -E "Error occurred while handling event|creativecompat" logs/kubejs/server.log | head -6 | cut -c1-220; grep -c "Error occurred while handling event" logs/latest.log; true
kjsreject Error occurred while handling event
> reload
waitlog (Reloaded|reload) 180
sleep 10
shell grep -cE "Error occurred while handling event|ReferenceError" logs/kubejs/server.log; true
look no script error from moved Compat files; /reload clean

