@group A
@commands In the Nether: `execute in minecraft:the_nether run summon corpse:corpse 0 64 0 {Tags:["c13a"],Death:{PlayerName:"Test",MainInventory:[{Slot:0b,id:"minecraft:stone",Count:1b}]},"creativecompat:corpse":{DeathTime:-30000L}}`, a second (`c13b`) with `DeathTime:-60000L`; in the End a third (`c13c`) with `DeathTime:-500000L`; forceload each spot; wait 3 s; read each `Stage`
@pass c13a 1b, c13b 2b, c13c 0b
@fails c13b 1b: the Nether list does not match the dimension id; c13c 1b: the End is not in `noDecayDimensions`
@absent creativecompat:corpse (an NBT compound key on the corpse entity, not a registry id)
> execute in minecraft:the_nether run forceload add 0 0
> execute in minecraft:the_end run forceload add 100 0
> execute in minecraft:the_nether run summon corpse:corpse 0 64 0 {Tags:["c13a"],Death:{PlayerName:"Test",MainInventory:[{Slot:0b,id:"minecraft:stone",Count:1b}]},"creativecompat:corpse":{DeathTime:-30000L}}
> execute in minecraft:the_nether run summon corpse:corpse 2 64 0 {Tags:["c13b"],Death:{PlayerName:"Test",MainInventory:[{Slot:0b,id:"minecraft:stone",Count:1b}]},"creativecompat:corpse":{DeathTime:-60000L}}
> execute in minecraft:the_end run summon corpse:corpse 100 64 0 {Tags:["c13c"],NoGravity:1b,Death:{PlayerName:"Test",MainInventory:[{Slot:0b,id:"minecraft:stone",Count:1b}]},"creativecompat:corpse":{DeathTime:-500000L}}
sleep 3
> execute in minecraft:the_nether run data get entity @e[tag=c13a,limit=1] "creativecompat:corpse".Stage
expect 1b
> execute in minecraft:the_nether run data get entity @e[tag=c13b,limit=1] "creativecompat:corpse".Stage
