## CQ-CMP-15 | Cosmetic armor goes into the corpse and back
@group client
@commands Survival client: wear a cosmetic helmet (Cosmetic Armor Reworked slot) and a real chestplate, die; open the corpse; Transfer Items
@pass the cosmetic helmet is not on the respawned player; the corpse holds it; after Transfer Items it is back in the cosmetic helmet slot, the chestplate in the armor slot; with Corpse Curios Compat, a curio worn at death returns to its curio slot the same way
@fails the helmet stays on the player: `CosArmorKeepThroughDeath` still true (config not copied to the client or server folder); it lands in the inventory, not the cosmetic slot: Cosmetic Armor x Corpse Compat missing
@sources feature_writeup/plan_corpses.md config/cosmeticarmorreworked-common.toml
